Reserve button shows error for unavailable dates\n537:#### Test: Booking card is sticky on desktop viewport\n542:#### Test: Booking card date pickers and guest selector are functional on repeated use\n547:### Component: ReviewsSection\n549:#### Test: Reviews section displays average ratings by category\n553:#### Test: Reviews section displays overall average rating and total review count\n557:#### Test: Reviews section displays individual review cards\n561:#### Test: Review cards display guest avatar or initial\n565:#### Test: Reviews section shows message when property has no reviews\n569:#### Test: Reviews section handles pagination or \"Show more\" for many reviews\n573:#### Test: Clicking \"Show all reviews\" reveals all review cards\n578:#### Test: Reviews are ordered by most recent first\n582:### Component: HostInfoCard\n584:#### Test: Host info card displays host name, avatar, bio, and member since date\n588:#### Test: Host info card displays number of listings\n592:#### Test: Host info card shows placeholder avatar when host has no avatar\n596:#### Test: Host info card displays correctly when host has no bio\n600:## Page: My Trips (`/trips`)\n604:### Component: TripsTabs\n606:#### Test: My Trips page requires login\n611:#### Test: My Trips page defaults to Upcoming tab\n615:#### Test: Upcoming tab shows pending and confirmed future bookings\n620:#### Test: Switching to Past tab shows completed bookings\n625:#### Test: Switching to Cancelled tab shows cancelled bookings\n630:#### Test: Switching back to Upcoming tab from another tab\n635:#### Test: Tab shows empty state when no bookings exist for that category\n640:#### Test: Upcoming tab empty state message\n645:#### Test: Cancelled tab empty state message\n650:#### Test: Tabs are functional on repeated use\n655:### Component: TripCard\n657:#### Test: Trip card displays all required information\n661:#### Test: Trip card displays correct status badge colors\n665:#### Test: Trip card shows property image or placeholder\n669:#### Test: Clicking trip card navigates to booking details\n674:#### Test: Cancel button appears on pending bookings\n678:#### Test: Cancel button appears on confirmed bookings\n682:#### Test: Cancel button does not appear on completed bookings\n686:#### Test: Cancel button does not appear on already cancelled bookings\n690:#### Test: Write Review button appears on completed bookings without a review\n694:#### Test: Write Review button does not appear on completed bookings that already have a review\n698:#### Test: Clicking Write Review button navigates to review page\n703:#### Test: Write Review button does not appear on pending, confirmed, or cancelled bookings\n707:#### Test: Trip cards are ordered by check-in date\n711:### Component: CancelBookingDialog\n713:#### Test: Clicking Cancel button opens confirmation dialog\n718:#### Test: Confirming cancellation updates booking status to cancelled\n723:#### Test: Dismissing cancellation dialog keeps booking unchanged\n728:#### Test: Closing the dialog via overlay click keeps booking unchanged\n733:#### Test: Cancel dialog shows property and date context\n737:#### Test: After cancellation, booking moves from Upcoming to Cancelled tab\n742:#### Test: Cancel dialog is functional on repeated use\n747:## Page: Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)\n751:### Component: StatsOverview\n753:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires login — redirects unauthenticated users\n758:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires host status — shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts\n763:#### Test: Stats overview displays total listings count\n768:#### Test: Stats overview displays active bookings count\n773:#### Test: Stats overview displays total earnings\n778:#### Test: Stats overview displays average rating\n783:#### Test: Stats overview shows zeros for a new host with no data\n788:#### Test: Host Dashboard displays navigation tabs for Listings and Bookings\n793:#### Test: Switching between Listings and Bookings tabs\n798:### Component: ListingsTab\n800:#### Test: Listings tab displays host's properties in a grid\n805:#### Test: Listing card shows property details\n809:#### Test: Listing card has Edit button that navigates to property detail\n814:#### Test: Listing card has Deactivate button for active properties\n819:#### Test: Confirming deactivation sets property to inactive\n824:#### Test: Dismissing deactivation dialog keeps property active\n829:#### Test: Listing card shows Activate button for inactive properties\n834:#### Test: Listings tab shows empty state for host with no properties\n838:#### Test: Add Listing button is visible on the Listings tab\n842:#### Test: Deactivate and activate actions work on repeated use\n847:### Component: BookingsTab\n849:#### Test: Bookings tab displays table of bookings for host's properties\n854:#### Test: Bookings table shows correct data for each booking\n858:#### Test: Bookings tab has status filter controls\n862:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Pending status\n867:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Confirmed status\n872:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Completed status\n877:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Cancelled status\n882:#### Test: Resetting filter to All shows all bookings\n887:#### Test: Status filters work on repeated use\n892:#### Test: Host can confirm a pending booking\n897:#### Test: Host can cancel a pending booking\n902:#### Test: Confirming cancellation of a booking updates status\n907:#### Test: Dismissing booking cancellation dialog keeps booking unchanged\n912:#### Test: Host can cancel a confirmed booking\n917:#### Test: Completed and cancelled bookings have no action buttons\n921:#### Test: Bookings tab shows empty state when no bookings exist\n926:#### Test: Status badges display correct colors\n930:#### Test: Confirm and cancel actions work on repeated use\n935:### Component: AddListingForm\n937:#### Test: Clicking Add Listing button opens the multi-step form\n942:#### Test: Step 1 — Property type selection and title input\n946:#### Test: Step 1 — Selecting property type and entering title\n951:#### Test: Step 1 — Validation prevents proceeding without required fields\n956:#### Test: Step 2 — Location fields displayed\n960:#### Test: Step 2 — Address field uses autocomplete\n965:#### Test: Step 2 — Address autocomplete populates related fields\n970:#### Test: Step 2 — Validation requires city and country\n975:#### Test: Step 3 — Details fields displayed\n979:#### Test: Step 3 — Setting property details\n984:#### Test: Step 3 — Validation requires all detail fields\n989:#### Test: Step 4 — Amenities selection displayed\n993:#### Test: Step 4 — Selecting amenities\n998:#### Test: Step 4 — Amenities are toggleable\n1003:#### Test: Step 5 — Photo URL input displayed\n1007:#### Test: Step 5 — Adding a photo URL\n1012:#### Test: Step 5 — Adding multiple photo URLs\n1017:#### Test: Step 5 — Removing a photo\n1022:#### Test: Step 5 — Validation requires at least one photo\n1027:#### Test: Step 6 — Pricing fields displayed\n1031:#### Test: Step 6 — Entering pricing information\n1036:#### Test: Step 6 — Validation requires price per night\n1041:#### Test: Step 7 — Review and publish page displayed\n1045:#### Test: Step 7 — Review page shows all entered data correctly\n1049:#### Test: Publishing a new listing creates the property\n1054:#### Test: Back button navigates to the previous step\n1059:#### Test: Cancel button closes the form without saving\n1064:#### Test: Confirming cancel discards the listing form\n1069:#### Test: Dismissing cancel keeps the form open\n1074:#### Test: Step indicator shows correct progress throughout the form\n1079:#### Test: Data persistence across steps when navigating back and forth\n1084:#### Test: Add Listing form works correctly on repeated use\n1089:## Page: User Profile (`/profile`)\n1093:### Component: ProfileForm\n1095:#### Test: Profile page requires login\n1100:#### Test: Profile page displays current user info\n1105:#### Test: Edit name field inline\n1110:#### Test: Edit bio field inline\n1115:#### Test: Edit phone field inline\n1120:#### Test: Edit avatar URL field inline\n1125:#### Test: Save with empty name shows validation error\n1130:#### Test: Save with invalid avatar URL shows validation error\n1135:#### Test: Profile form fields are functional on repeated edits\n1140:#### Test: Email field is displayed but not editable\n1145:#### Test: Profile update persists across navigation\n1150:### Component: BecomeHostButton\n1152:#### Test: Become a Host button is visible for non-host users\n1157:#### Test: Become a Host button is hidden for existing hosts\n1162:#### Test: Clicking Become a Host sets user as host\n1167:#### Test: Cancel Become a Host confirmation dialog\n1172:#### Test: Become a Host button appearance\n1177:### Component: UserReviewsList\n1179:#### Test: Reviews list displays user's written reviews\n1184:#### Test: Reviews list shows empty state for user with no reviews\n1189:#### Test: Review card shows rating with star display\n1194:#### Test: Review card links to the reviewed property\n1199:#### Test: Reviews list shows review details correctly\n1204:#### Test: Reviews list updates after writing a new review\n1209:#### Test: Reviews list shows multiple reviews in chronological order\n1214:## Page: Write Review (`/trips/:bookingId/review`)\n1218:### Component: PropertyBookingContext\n1220:#### Test: Property info displays for the booking being reviewed\n1225:#### Test: Property booking context shows guest count\n1230:#### Test: Property booking context shows total price paid\n1235:#### Test: Redirect to login if not authenticated\n1240:#### Test: Error state when booking does not exist\n1245:#### Test: Error state when booking belongs to another user\n1250:#### Test: Error state when booking is not completed\n1255:#### Test: Error state when review already exists for booking\n1260:### Component: RatingSliders\n1262:#### Test: All six rating sliders display with default values\n1266:#### Test: Adjust overall rating slider\n1271:#### Test: Adjust cleanliness rating slider\n1276:#### Test: Adjust accuracy rating slider\n1281:#### Test: Adjust communication rating slider\n1286:#### Test: Adjust location rating slider\n1291:#### Test: Adjust value rating slider\n1296:#### Test: Rating sliders enforce 1-5 range\n1301:#### Test: Multiple sliders can be set independently\n1306:#### Test: Rating slider visual feedback shows filled stars or highlighted segments\n1311:### Component: ReviewForm\n1313:#### Test: Review form displays comment text area\n1317:#### Test: Submit button is visible\n1321:#### Test: Type a comment in the text area\n1326:#### Test: Submit review with all ratings and comment\n1331:#### Test: Submitted review appears on property detail page\n1336:#### Test: Submitted review appears in user profile reviews list\n1341:#### Test: Submit review with ratings but no comment\n1346:#### Test: Submit button is disabled when ratings are not set\n1350:#### Test: Form validation prevents submission without all ratings\n1355:#### Test: Write Review button on My Trips disappears after submitting review\n1360:#### Test: Navigate back from review page without submitting\n1365:#### Test: Comment text area allows multi-line input\n1370:#### Test: Re-visiting review page after submission shows already-reviewed state"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55e090e7-21aa-46b7-b7e3-23c619f4259f","uuid":"a4301fa5-9aac-4990-8a4b-1b54d7234dcf","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"3:## Page: Login / Register (`/login`)\n7:### Component: AuthToggle\n9:#### Test: Auth page defaults to login mode\n13:#### Test: Toggle from login to register mode\n18:#### Test: Toggle from register back to login mode\n23:#### Test: Toggle preserves no stale input between modes\n28:### Component: LoginForm\n30:#### Test: Login with valid email redirects to home\n35:#### Test: Login with empty email shows validation error\n40:#### Test: Login with invalid email format shows validation error\n45:#### Test: Login with non-existent email shows error\n50:#### Test: Login form email input is functional on repeated use\n55:### Component: RegisterForm\n57:#### Test: Register with valid name and email creates account and redirects to home\n62:#### Test: Register with empty name shows validation error\n67:#### Test: Register with empty email shows validation error\n72:#### Test: Register with invalid email format shows validation error\n77:#### Test: Register with already-existing email shows error\n82:#### Test: Register form fields are functional on repeated use\n87:## Page: Home / Search (`/`)\n91:### Component: SearchBar\n93:#### Test: Search bar displays all input fields on load\n97:#### Test: Search by location filters property results\n102:#### Test: Search by check-in and check-out dates filters results\n107:#### Test: Search by guest count filters results\n112:#### Test: Combined search with all fields filters results\n117:#### Test: Clearing search fields and re-searching shows all results\n122:#### Test: Search bar is functional on repeated use\n127:#### Test: Check-in date picker prevents selecting past dates\n132:#### Test: Check-out date must be after check-in date\n137:#### Test: Guest count selector enforces minimum of 1\n142:### Component: CategoryFilter\n144:#### Test: Category filter bar displays all property type chips\n148:#### Test: Clicking a category chip filters properties by that type\n153:#### Test: Clicking the selected category chip deselects it and shows all properties\n158:#### Test: Switching between category chips updates the filter\n163:#### Test: Category filter works in combination with search bar\n168:#### Test: Category filter bar is horizontally scrollable when chips overflow\n172:#### Test: Category chip is functional on repeated use\n177:### Component: PropertyGrid\n179:#### Test: Property grid displays properties in a responsive grid layout\n183:#### Test: Property grid shows message when no properties match filters\n188:#### Test: Property grid loads and displays properties from API on initial page load\n192:### Component: PropertyCard\n194:#### Test: Property card displays all required information\n198:#### Test: Property card shows property image\n202:#### Test: Clicking a property card navigates to property detail page\n207:#### Test: Property card displays property type badge\n211:#### Test: Property card displays average rating with review count\n215:### Component: FavoriteButton\n217:#### Test: Favorite button shows outline heart when property is not favorited\n221:#### Test: Clicking favorite button on unfavorited property adds it to favorites\n226:#### Test: Clicking favorite button on favorited property removes it from favorites\n231:#### Test: Favorite button does not navigate to property detail page\n236:#### Test: Favorite button is not shown when user is not logged in\n240:#### Test: Favorite button reflects correct state on page load\n244:#### Test: Favorite button is functional on repeated use\n249:### Component: FiltersPanel\n251:#### Test: Filters panel is hidden by default with a visible toggle button\n255:#### Test: Clicking the Filters button opens the filters panel\n260:#### Test: Clicking the Filters button again closes the filters panel\n265:#### Test: Price range slider filters properties by price per night\n270:#### Test: Bedrooms minimum filter works correctly\n275:#### Test: Beds minimum filter works correctly\n280:#### Test: Bathrooms minimum filter works correctly\n285:#### Test: Amenity checkboxes filter properties by selected amenities\n290:#### Test: Amenity checkboxes are grouped by category\n294:#### Test: Multiple filters combine with AND logic\n299:#### Test: Filters combine with search bar and category filter\n304:#### Test: Resetting filters shows all properties\n309:#### Test: Filters panel controls are functional on repeated use\n314:### Component: Pagination\n316:#### Test: Pagination controls are displayed when results exceed one page\n320:#### Test: Pagination controls are hidden when all results fit on one page\n324:#### Test: Clicking Next page loads the next set of properties\n329:#### Test: Clicking Previous page loads the previous set of properties\n334:#### Test: Clicking a specific page number navigates to that page\n339:#### Test: Next button is disabled on the last page\n343:#### Test: Previous button is disabled on the first page\n347:#### Test: Applying filters resets pagination to page 1\n352:#### Test: Pagination is functional on repeated use\n357:## Page: Property Detail (`/properties/:id`)\n361:### Component: ImageGallery\n363:#### Test: Image gallery displays main large image and smaller thumbnails\n367:#### Test: Image gallery displays single image when property has only one image\n371:#### Test: Image gallery displays placeholder when property has no images\n375:#### Test: Clicking a thumbnail image makes it the main displayed image\n380:#### Test: Clicking thumbnails is functional on repeated use\n385:#### Test: Image gallery shows image captions when available\n389:### Component: PropertyHeader\n391:#### Test: Property header displays title, location, rating summary, and host info\n395:#### Test: Property header shows \"New\" when property has no reviews\n399:#### Test: Clicking review count scrolls to or navigates to reviews section\n404:#### Test: Property header displays host avatar as clickable element\n408:### Component: PropertyInfo\n410:#### Test: Property info section displays all property details\n414:#### Test: Property info section displays check-in and check-out times\n418:#### Test: Property info section handles singular and plural labels correctly\n422:### Component: PropertyDescription\n424:#### Test: Property description displays full description text\n428:#### Test: Long description shows a \"Show more\" toggle\n432:#### Test: Clicking \"Show more\" expands the full description\n437:#### Test: Clicking \"Show less\" collapses the description back\n442:#### Test: Show more/less toggle is functional on repeated use\n447:### Component: AmenitiesList\n449:#### Test: Amenities list displays amenities grouped by category with icons\n453:#### Test: Amenities list only shows categories that have amenities\n457:#### Test: Amenities list shows \"Show all amenities\" when there are many amenities\n461:#### Test: Clicking \"Show all amenities\" reveals the complete list\n466:#### Test: Amenities list displays message when property has no amenities\n470:### Component: BookingCard\n472:#### Test: Booking card displays price per night\n476:#### Test: Booking card displays check-in and check-out date pickers\n480:#### Test: Booking card displays guest count selector\n484:#### Test: Selecting dates and guests shows price breakdown\n489:#### Test: Price breakdown updates when dates change\n494:#### Test: Reserve button creates a booking when logged in\n499:#### Test: Reserve button is disabled when dates are not selected\n503:#### Test: Reserve button prompts login when user is not logged in\n508:#### Test: Reserve button is disabled for host's own property\n512:#### Test: Check-in date picker prevents selecting past dates\n517:#### Test: Check-out date must be after check-in date\n522:#### Test: Guest count cannot exceed property max_guests\n527:#### Test: Guest count minimum is 1\n532:#### Test: Reserve button shows error for unavailable dates\n537:#### Test: Booking card is sticky on desktop viewport\n542:#### Test: Booking card date pickers and guest selector are functional on repeated use\n547:### Component: ReviewsSection\n549:#### Test: Reviews section displays average ratings by category\n553:#### Test: Reviews section displays overall average rating and total review count\n557:#### Test: Reviews section displays individual review cards\n561:#### Test: Review cards display guest avatar or initial\n565:#### Test: Reviews section shows message when property has no reviews\n569:#### Test: Reviews section handles pagination or \"Show more\" for many reviews\n573:#### Test: Clicking \"Show all reviews\" reveals all review cards\n578:#### Test: Reviews are ordered by most recent first\n582:### Component: HostInfoCard\n584:#### Test: Host info card displays host name, avatar, bio, and member since date\n588:#### Test: Host info card displays number of listings\n592:#### Test: Host info card shows placeholder avatar when host has no avatar\n596:#### Test: Host info card displays correctly when host has no bio\n600:## Page: My Trips (`/trips`)\n604:### Component: TripsTabs\n606:#### Test: My Trips page requires login\n611:#### Test: My Trips page defaults to Upcoming tab\n615:#### Test: Upcoming tab shows pending and confirmed future bookings\n620:#### Test: Switching to Past tab shows completed bookings\n625:#### Test: Switching to Cancelled tab shows cancelled bookings\n630:#### Test: Switching back to Upcoming tab from another tab\n635:#### Test: Tab shows empty state when no bookings exist for that category\n640:#### Test: Upcoming tab empty state message\n645:#### Test: Cancelled tab empty state message\n650:#### Test: Tabs are functional on repeated use\n655:### Component: TripCard\n657:#### Test: Trip card displays all required information\n661:#### Test: Trip card displays correct status badge colors\n665:#### Test: Trip card shows property image or placeholder\n669:#### Test: Clicking trip card navigates to booking details\n674:#### Test: Cancel button appears on pending bookings\n678:#### Test: Cancel button appears on confirmed bookings\n682:#### Test: Cancel button does not appear on completed bookings\n686:#### Test: Cancel button does not appear on already cancelled bookings\n690:#### Test: Write Review button appears on completed bookings without a review\n694:#### Test: Write Review button does not appear on completed bookings that already have a review\n698:#### Test: Clicking Write Review button navigates to review page\n703:#### Test: Write Review button does not appear on pending, confirmed, or cancelled bookings\n707:#### Test: Trip cards are ordered by check-in date\n711:### Component: CancelBookingDialog\n713:#### Test: Clicking Cancel button opens confirmation dialog\n718:#### Test: Confirming cancellation updates booking status to cancelled\n723:#### Test: Dismissing cancellation dialog keeps booking unchanged\n728:#### Test: Closing the dialog via overlay click keeps booking unchanged\n733:#### Test: Cancel dialog shows property and date context\n737:#### Test: After cancellation, booking moves from Upcoming to Cancelled tab\n742:#### Test: Cancel dialog is functional on repeated use\n747:## Page: Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)\n751:### Component: StatsOverview\n753:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires login — redirects unauthenticated users\n758:#### Test: Host Dashboard requires host status — shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts\n763:#### Test: Stats overview displays total listings count\n768:#### Test: Stats overview displays active bookings count\n773:#### Test: Stats overview displays total earnings\n778:#### Test: Stats overview displays average rating\n783:#### Test: Stats overview shows zeros for a new host with no data\n788:#### Test: Host Dashboard displays navigation tabs for Listings and Bookings\n793:#### Test: Switching between Listings and Bookings tabs\n798:### Component: ListingsTab\n800:#### Test: Listings tab displays host's properties in a grid\n805:#### Test: Listing card shows property details\n809:#### Test: Listing card has Edit button that navigates to property detail\n814:#### Test: Listing card has Deactivate button for active properties\n819:#### Test: Confirming deactivation sets property to inactive\n824:#### Test: Dismissing deactivation dialog keeps property active\n829:#### Test: Listing card shows Activate button for inactive properties\n834:#### Test: Listings tab shows empty state for host with no properties\n838:#### Test: Add Listing button is visible on the Listings tab\n842:#### Test: Deactivate and activate actions work on repeated use\n847:### Component: BookingsTab\n849:#### Test: Bookings tab displays table of bookings for host's properties\n854:#### Test: Bookings table shows correct data for each booking\n858:#### Test: Bookings tab has status filter controls\n862:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Pending status\n867:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Confirmed status\n872:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Completed status\n877:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Cancelled status\n882:#### Test: Resetting filter to All shows all bookings\n887:#### Test: Status filters work on repeated use\n892:#### Test: Host can confirm a pending booking\n897:#### Test: Host can cancel a pending booking\n902:#### Test: Confirming cancellation of a booking updates status\n907:#### Test: Dismissing booking cancellation dialog keeps booking unchanged\n912:#### Test: Host can cancel a confirmed booking\n917:#### Test: Completed and cancelled bookings have no action buttons\n921:#### Test: Bookings tab shows empty state when no bookings exist\n926:#### Test: Status badges display correct colors\n930:#### Test: Confirm and cancel actions work on repeated use\n935:### Component: AddListingForm\n937:#### Test: Clicking Add Listing button opens the multi-step form\n942:#### Test: Step 1 — Property type selection and title input\n946:#### Test: Step 1 — Selecting property type and entering title\n951:#### Test: Step 1 — Validation prevents proceeding without required fields\n956:#### Test: Step 2 — Location fields displayed\n960:#### Test: Step 2 — Address field uses autocomplete\n965:#### Test: Step 2 — Address autocomplete populates related fields\n970:#### Test: Step 2 — Validation requires city and country\n975:#### Test: Step 3 — Details fields displayed\n979:#### Test: Step 3 — Setting property details\n984:#### Test: Step 3 — Validation requires all detail fields\n989:#### Test: Step 4 — Amenities selection displayed\n993:#### Test: Step 4 — Selecting amenities\n998:#### Test: Step 4 — Amenities are toggleable\n1003:#### Test: Step 5 — Photo URL input displayed\n1007:#### Test: Step 5 — Adding a photo URL\n1012:#### Test: Step 5 — Adding multiple photo URLs\n1017:#### Test: Step 5 — Removing a photo\n1022:#### Test: Step 5 — Validation requires at least one photo\n1027:#### Test: Step 6 — Pricing fields displayed\n1031:#### Test: Step 6 — Entering pricing information\n1036:#### Test: Step 6 — Validation requires price per night\n1041:#### Test: Step 7 — Review and publish page displayed\n1045:#### Test: Step 7 — Review page shows all entered data correctly\n1049:#### Test: Publishing a new listing creates the property\n1054:#### Test: Back button navigates to the previous step\n1059:#### Test: Cancel button closes the form without saving\n1064:#### Test: Confirming cancel discards the listing form\n1069:#### Test: Dismissing cancel keeps the form open\n1074:#### Test: Step indicator shows correct progress throughout the form\n1079:#### Test: Data persistence across steps when navigating back and forth\n1084:#### Test: Add Listing form works correctly on repeated use\n1089:## Page: User Profile (`/profile`)\n1093:### Component: ProfileForm\n1095:#### Test: Profile page requires login\n1100:#### Test: Profile page displays current user info\n1105:#### Test: Edit name field inline\n1110:#### Test: Edit bio field inline\n1115:#### Test: Edit phone field inline\n1120:#### Test: Edit avatar URL field inline\n1125:#### Test: Save with empty name shows validation error\n1130:#### Test: Save with invalid avatar URL shows validation error\n1135:#### Test: Profile form fields are functional on repeated edits\n1140:#### Test: Email field is displayed but not editable\n1145:#### Test: Profile update persists across navigation\n1150:### Component: BecomeHostButton\n1152:#### Test: Become a Host button is visible for non-host users\n1157:#### Test: Become a Host button is hidden for existing hosts\n1162:#### Test: Clicking Become a Host sets user as host\n1167:#### Test: Cancel Become a Host confirmation dialog\n1172:#### Test: Become a Host button appearance\n1177:### Component: UserReviewsList\n1179:#### Test: Reviews list displays user's written reviews\n1184:#### Test: Reviews list shows empty state for user with no reviews\n1189:#### Test: Review card shows rating with star display\n1194:#### Test: Review card links to the reviewed property\n1199:#### Test: Reviews list shows review details correctly\n1204:#### Test: Reviews list updates after writing a new review\n1209:#### Test: Reviews list shows multiple reviews in chronological order\n1214:## Page: Write Review (`/trips/:bookingId/review`)\n1218:### Component: PropertyBookingContext\n1220:#### Test: Property info displays for the booking being reviewed\n1225:#### Test: Property booking context shows guest count\n1230:#### Test: Property booking context shows total price paid\n1235:#### Test: Redirect to login if not authenticated\n1240:#### Test: Error state when booking does not exist\n1245:#### Test: Error state when booking belongs to another user\n1250:#### Test: Error state when booking is not completed\n1255:#### Test: Error state when review already exists for booking\n1260:### Component: RatingSliders\n1262:#### Test: All six rating sliders display with default values\n1266:#### Test: Adjust overall rating slider\n1271:#### Test: Adjust cleanliness rating slider\n1276:#### Test: Adjust accuracy rating slider\n1281:#### Test: Adjust communication rating slider\n1286:#### Test: Adjust location rating slider\n1291:#### Test: Adjust value rating slider\n1296:#### Test: Rating sliders enforce 1-5 range\n1301:#### Test: Multiple sliders can be set independently\n1306:#### Test: Rating slider visual feedback shows filled stars or highlighted segments\n1311:### Component: ReviewForm\n1313:#### Test: Review form displays comment text area\n1317:#### Test: Submit button is visible\n1321:#### Test: Type a comment in the text area\n1326:#### Test: Submit review with all ratings and comment\n1331:#### Test: Submitted review appears on property detail page\n1336:#### Test: Submitted review appears in user profile reviews list\n1341:#### Test: Submit review with ratings but no comment\n1346:#### Test: Submit button is disabled when ratings are not set\n1350:#### Test: Form validation prevents submission without all ratings\n1355:#### Test: Write Review button on My Trips disappears after submitting review\n1360:#### Test: Navigate back from review page without submitting\n1365:#### Test: Comment text area allows multi-line input\n1370:#### Test: Re-visiting review page after submission shows already-reviewed state","numLines":311}}
